[{"id":"OTg-q01","number":1,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Spesi anion ?&nbsp;mempunyai:</p>","choices":["17 proton, 17 neutron, dan 16 elektron.","17 proton, 20 neutron, dan 18 elektron.","16 proton, 21 neutron, dan 17 elektron.","17 proton, 17 neutron, dan 20 elektron.","17 proton, 17 neutron, dan 18 elektron."],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDU1OQ"},{"id":"OTg-q02","number":2,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Sebanyak 3,82 g kalsium sulfit, CaSO3 direaksikan dengan larutan HCI berlebih. Berapa volume (mL) gas sulfur dioksida, SO2 yang dapat dihasilkan bila tekanan akhir&nbsp;SO2 adalah 827 mmHg pada temperatur 44,0 &deg;C?</p>","choices":["<img alt=\"\\small 7,39 \\bullet 10\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%207%2C39%20%5Cbullet%2010\" />","<img alt=\"\\small 578\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20578\" />","<img alt=\"\\small 1,00 \\bullet 10^{-3}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%201%2C00%20%5Cbullet%2010%5E%7B-3%7D\" />","<img alt=\"\\small 0,106\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%200%2C106\" />","<img alt=\"\\small 761\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20761\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDU2MA"},{"id":"OTg-q03","number":3,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200407132613.PNG\" style=\"height:200px; width:453px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDU2MQ"},{"id":"OTg-q04","number":4,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Anggaplah bahwa setiap gas bersifat ideal. Hitunglah berapa kerja yang dilakukan, dalam jouie, untuk perubahan 1,00 mol Ni menjadi Ni(CO)4 pada 75&deg;C seperti reaksi berikut ini, Ni(s) + 4CO(g) -+ Ni(CO)&lsaquo;(g); Nilai <em>R </em>adalah 8,314 J/moI&bull;K.</p><p><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200408035633.PNG\" style=\"height:88px; width:102px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDU2Mg"},{"id":"OTg-q05","number":5,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Darah manusia memberikan tekanan osmosis sebesar 7,25 atm pada temperatur tubuh 37&quot;C. Berapa molaritas larutan glukosa intravena (larutan untuk infus) yang dapat memberikan tekanan osmosis yang sama seperti tekanan darah manusia?</p>","choices":["0,285 mol/L","0,339 mol/L","0,512 mol/L","2,467 mol/L","3,704 ml /L"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDU2Mw"},{"id":"OTg-q06","number":6,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Muatan formal atom C, O dan Cl yang diberi tanda dari struktur Lewis berikut ini berturut-turut adalah:</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200407132810.PNG\" style=\"height:91px; width:125px\" /></p>","choices":["0, 0, 0","0, -1, -1","+1, -1, 0","-1, +1, 0","0,&nbsp; +1, 0"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDU2NA"},{"id":"OTg-q07","number":7,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Dalam molekul metanol berikut ini, berturut-turut, apa jenis orbital hibrida digunakan untuk atom karbon dan oksigen?</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200407132856.PNG\" style=\"height:171px; width:260px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDU2NQ"},{"id":"OTg-q08","number":8,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Dari senyawa berikut ini:</p><p>I. CH3CH3</p><p>II. CH3CH2CH3</p><p>III. CH3CH2NH2</p><p>IV. CH3CH2F</p><p>Urutkanlah (dari yang paling lemah ke yang paling kuat) berdasarkan kekuatan interaksi antar-molekulnya.</p>","choices":["IV &lt; III &lt; II &lt; I","III &lt; IV &lt; I &lt; II","c. ii &bull; iii &lt; iv &lt; ii","I &lt; II &lt; IV &lt; IU","I &lt; III &lt; II &lt; IV"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDU2Ng"},{"id":"OTg-q09","number":9,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Untuk &nbsp;reaksi :&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <img alt=\"\\small Ag2CO3(s)\\;\\; Ag2O\\: \\: \\: C 2(g)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20Ag2CO3%28s%29%5C%3B%5C%3B%20Ag2O%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20C%202%28g%29\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Pada <img alt=\"\\small 298\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20298\" /> K nilai Kp =<img alt=\"\\small 3,1610-^3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%203%2C1610-%5E3\" /> atm dan pada 500 K Nilai <img alt=\"\\small Kp = 1,48x10\\wedge\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20Kp%20%3D%201%2C48x10%5Cwedge\" /> &nbsp;atm. Pilihlah pernyataan yang paling benar mengenai reaksi tersebut:</p>","choices":["<img alt=\"\\small 6H\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%206H\" /> reaksi dapat diabaikan","Hasil <img alt=\"\\small CO2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20CO2\" /> bertambah bila tekanan sistem dinaikkan","Hasil <img alt=\"\\small CO2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20CO2\" /> tidak tergantung temperatur","Reaksi tersebut adalah endoterm","Nilai Kp ditentukan dari jumlah <img alt=\"\\small Ag2CO3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20Ag2CO3\" /> yang digunakan. x"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDU2Nw"},{"id":"OTg-q10","number":10,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Garam-garam berikut ini, bila dilarutkan dalam air manakah yang memberikan larutan dengan pH paling tinggi?</p>","choices":["KI","KBr","KCI","KF","Semua garam di atas"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDU2OA"},{"id":"OTg-q11","number":11,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Berikut ini manakah reaksi Asam Basa menurut teori Bronsted-Lowry?</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200407133426.PNG\" style=\"height:287px; width:400px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDU2OQ"},{"id":"OTg-q12","number":12,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Reaksi hidrolisis 2-bromo-2-metiIpropana [(CH3)3CBr] dalam suasana alkali:</p><p>(CH3)3C-Br + OH&quot;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (CH3)3C-OH + Br</p><p>Berlangsung 2 tahapan reaksi:</p><p>(CH3)3C-Br 4&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (CH3)3C&rsquo; + Br&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (lamban) (CH3)3C* + OH-4&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (CH3)3C-OH&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (cepat)</p><p>Persamaan laju reaksi (r) yang sesuai dengan tahapan reaksi di atas adalah:</p>","choices":["<img alt=\"\\small r = k [OH-]\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20r%20%3D%20k%20%5BOH-%5D\" />","<img alt=\"\\small r = k [(CH3)3C-Brj\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20r%20%3D%20k%20%5B%28CH3%293C-Brj\" />","<img alt=\"\\small r = k [(CH3)3C-Br]^2\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20r%20%3D%20k%20%5B%28CH3%293C-Br%5D%5E2\" />","<img alt=\"\\small r = k k [(CH3)3C -Br][OH-]\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20r%20%3D%20k%20k%20%5B%28CH3%293C%20-Br%5D%5BOH-%5D\" />","<img alt=\"\\small r = k [(CH3)3C*j(OH-]\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20r%20%3D%20k%20%5B%28CH3%293C*j%28OH-%5D\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDU3MA"},{"id":"OTg-q13","number":13,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Reaksi redoks berikut ini:</p><p>Mn&quot;*</p><p><img alt=\"\\small TI* + 2Ce^{4*} -+Tl^{3*} + 2Ce^{3*}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20TI*%20&amp;plus;%202Ce%5E%7B4*%7D%20-&amp;plus;Tl%5E%7B3*%7D%20&amp;plus;%202Ce%5E%7B3*%7D\" /></p><p>Melalui eksperimen, ternyata persamaan hukum lajunya adalah:</p><p>Laju = <img alt=\"\\small r = k[Ce^{4*}][Mn^{2*}]\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20r%20%3D%20k%5BCe%5E%7B4*%7D%5D%5BMn%5E%7B2*%7D%5D\" /></p><p>Berikut ini adalah usulan mekanisme yang melibatkan ion mangan:</p><p>Langkah 1:&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small Ce^{4*} + Mn^{2*} -+ Ce^{3*} + Mn^{3*}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20Ce%5E%7B4*%7D%20&amp;plus;%20Mn%5E%7B2*%7D%20-&amp;plus;%20Ce%5E%7B3*%7D%20&amp;plus;%20Mn%5E%7B3*%7D\" /></p><p>Langkah 2:&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small Ce^{4*} + Mn^{3*} -+ Ce^{3*} Mn^4’\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20Ce%5E%7B4*%7D%20&amp;plus;%20Mn%5E%7B3*%7D%20-&amp;plus;%20Ce%5E%7B3*%7D%20Mn%5E4%u2019\" /></p><p>Langkah 3:&nbsp;<img alt=\"\\small *0 \\; \\; \\:\\; \\; \\; \\; \\; M \\: \\:\\: \\: \\: \\: \\: \\: \\: \\; T \\: \\: \\: \\: \\: \\: \\: + \\: Mn\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20*0%20%5C%3B%20%5C%3B%20%5C%3A%5C%3B%20%5C%3B%20%5C%3B%20%5C%3B%20%5C%3B%20M%20%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20%5C%3B%20T%20%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20&amp;plus;%20%5C%3A%20Mn\" /></p><p>Manakah Ion mangan yang berperan sebagai katalis dari informasi di atas?</p>","choices":["Mn4*","Mn&rsquo;*","Mn**","Semua ion Mangan di atas.","Tidak cukup informasi untuk menjawab pertanyaan tersebut"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDY4OQ"},{"id":"OTg-q14","number":14,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Dari diagram energi reaksi berikut ini (energi bebas Gibbs), manakah yang nilai tetapan kesetimbangan, <em>K, </em>sama dengan SATU?</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200408040823.PNG\" style=\"height:144px; width:439px\" />A. hanya I</p><p>B. hanya II</p><p>C. hanya III</p><p>D. I dan III</p><p>E. Semua jawaban benar</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDY5MA"},{"id":"OTg-q15","number":15,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Sejumlah arus yang sama dialirkan melalui KCI cair dan AI2O3 cair. Dalam sel yang&nbsp;mengandung KCI, dihasilkan 7,8 g K. Berapakah berat AI yang dihasilkan pada sel yang Iain ( Al = 27 ; K = 39 )</p>","choices":["5,4 g","3,6 g","2,7 g","1,8 g","2 g</p><p>&nbsp;"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDY5MQ"},{"id":"OTg-q16","number":16,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Reaksi berikut ini adalah reaksi yang terjadi pada sel volta:</p><p><img alt=\"\\small 3MnO\\leftarrow (aq) +24H(aq)+ 5Fe(s)-+ 3Mn^{2*}(aq) + 5Fe^{3’}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%203MnO%5Cleftarrow%20%28aq%29%20&amp;plus;24H%28aq%29&amp;plus;%205Fe%28s%29-&amp;plus;%203Mn%5E%7B2*%7D%28aq%29%20&amp;plus;%205Fe%5E%7B3%u2019%7D\" /><img alt=\"\\small (aq)+12H2O(/)\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%28aq%29&amp;plus;12H2O%28/%29\" /></p><p>Setengah reaksi yang terjadi di katoda adalah:<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200408041244.PNG\" style=\"height:96px; width:346px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDY5Mg"},{"id":"OTg-q17","number":17,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Potensial elektroda standar untuk logam X dan Y masing-masing adalah:</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200408041543.PNG\" style=\"height:44px; width:185px\" /></p><p>Ke dalam masing masing larutan ionnya dicelupkan elektroda masing-masing logam, X dan Y. Manakah yang benar mengenai deskripsi berikut ini ?</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200408041452.PNG\" style=\"height:155px; width:447px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDY5Mw"},{"id":"OTg-q18","number":18,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Dalam ion kompleks <img alt=\"\\small [Cr(H_2O)_4CI_2]^+\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5BCr%28H_2O%29_4CI_2%5D%5E&amp;plus;\" />apakah ligannya dan berapa bilangan&nbsp;koordinasinya?</p>","choices":["Ligan = <img alt=\"\\small CI-\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20CI-\" />, bilangan koordinasi = 2","Ligan = <img alt=\"\\small H_2O\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20H_2O\" />, bilangan koordinasi = 4","Ligan = <img alt=\"\\small H_2O\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20H_2O\" /> dan CI- , bilangan koordinasi = 6","Ligan = <img alt=\"\\small H_2O\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20H_2O\" /> dan Cl- , bilangan koordinasi = 8","Ligan = <img alt=\"\\small H_2O\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20H_2O\" />, bilangan koordinasi = 12"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDY5NA"},{"id":"OTg-q19","number":19,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Senyawa kompleks koordinasi berikut ini, manakah yang diharapkan tidak berwarna?</p>","choices":["<img alt=\"\\small [Fe(H_2O)_6]^{3*}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5BFe%28H_2O%29_6%5D%5E%7B3*%7D\" />","<img alt=\"\\small [Co(NH_3)_6]^{2*}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5BCo%28NH_3%29_6%5D%5E%7B2*%7D\" />","<img alt=\"\\small [Mn(CN)_6]^{3-}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5BMn%28CN%29_6%5D%5E%7B3-%7D\" />","<img alt=\"\\small [CrCl_3(SCN)_3]^{3-}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5BCrCl_3%28SCN%29_3%5D%5E%7B3-%7D\" />","<img alt=\"\\small [Ag(NO_2)_2]^-\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5BAg%28NO_2%29_2%5D%5E-\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDY5NQ"},{"id":"OTg-q20","number":20,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Bila sederetan peluruhan <img alt=\"\\small 222_{RN}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20222_%7BRN%7D\" /> terjadi dalam 5-Iangkah, produk akhir adalah <img alt=\"\\small 210_{Pb}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20210_%7BPb%7D\" />. Berapa banyak partikel alfa (<img alt=\"\\small \\alpha\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Calpha\" />) dan beta (<img alt=\"\\small \\beta\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Cbeta\" />) yang diemisikan dalam sederetan peluruhan ini?</p>","choices":["2<img alt=\"\\small \\alpha\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Calpha\" /> dan 3<img alt=\"\\small \\beta\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Cbeta\" />","3<img alt=\"\\small \\alpha\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Calpha\" />&nbsp; dan 2<img alt=\"\\small \\beta\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Cbeta\" />","4<img alt=\"\\small \\alpha\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Calpha\" />&nbsp; dan 1<img alt=\"\\small \\beta\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Cbeta\" />","1<img alt=\"\\small \\alpha\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Calpha\" />&nbsp; dan 4<img alt=\"\\small \\beta\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20%5Cbeta\" />","Keduanya , B dan C"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDY5Ng"},{"id":"OTg-q21","number":21,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Perhatikan ion organik di bawah ini</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200408042731.PNG\" style=\"height:78px; width:83px\" /></p><p>Berikut ini, manakah struktur resonansi yang TIDAK mewakili struktur resonansi yang tepat?</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200408042759.PNG\" style=\"height:293px; width:120px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDY5Nw"},{"id":"OTg-q22","number":22,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Dari resonansi senyawa di bawah ini, tentukan manakah yang bersifat aromatik dan non-aromatik</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200408042838.PNG\" style=\"height:144px; width:469px\" /></p>","choices":["V dan VI non-aromatik, VII dan VIII aromatik","I dan II aromatik, III dan IV non-aromatik","I dan II non-aromatik, III dan IV aromatik","V dan VI aromatik, VII dan VIII not-aromatik</p><p>C. I dan V non-aromatik, II dan VI aromatik"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDY5OA"},{"id":"OTg-q23","number":23,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Dari reaksi perpanjangan rantai senyawa hidrokarbon berikut ini, lengkapi pereaksi- pereaksi yang dibutuhkan:</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200408043040.PNG\" style=\"height:254px; width:500px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDY5OQ"},{"id":"OTg-q24","number":24,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Jika Senyawa 3-feniI-1-propena di bawah ini direaksikan dengan CI2.UV maka akan menghasilkan produk utamanya adalah :</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200408043135.PNG\" style=\"height:347px; width:393px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDcwMA"},{"id":"OTg-q25","number":25,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Pereaksi apa yang harus ditambahkan agar senyawa 1-feniI -1-propena menghasilkan produk utamanya adalah 1-fenil-1-kIoro propana</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200413125643.PNG\" style=\"height:88px; width:339px\" /></p>","choices":["<img alt=\"HCI\\: \\: Peroksida\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?HCI%5C%3A%20%5C%3A%20Peroksida\" />","<img alt=\"CI_2,H_2, Pt\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?CI_2%2CH_2%2C%20Pt\" />","<img alt=\"(C),CI_2,UV\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%28C%29%2CCI_2%2CUV\" />","<img alt=\"CI_2, AICI_3\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?CI_2%2C%20AICI_3\" />","<img alt=\"HCI\\: Tanpa \\: Perosida\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?HCI%5C%3A%20Tanpa%20%5C%3A%20Perosida\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDcwMQ"},{"id":"OTg-q26","number":26,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Gambarkan senyawa 1,2,4-trimetil sikloheksana berikut dalam konformasi kursi atau perahu. Tentukan konformasi manakah yang paling stabil ?</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200408043325.PNG\" style=\"height:411px; width:373px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDcwMg"},{"id":"OTg-q27","number":27,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Tentukan urutan kenaikan keasaman dari senyawa berikut:</p><p>1. <img alt=\"\\small CH_2F-CH_2-CH_2-COOH\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20CH_2F-CH_2-CH_2-COOH\" /></p><p>2. <img alt=\"\\small CH_3-CHF-CH_2-COOH\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20CH_3-CHF-CH_2-COOH\" /></p><p>3. <img alt=\"\\small CH_3-CH_2-CHF-COOH\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20CH_3-CH_2-CHF-COOH\" /></p><p>4. <img alt=\"\\small CH3-CH_2CH_2-COOH\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?%5Csmall%20CH3-CH_2CH_2-COOH\" /></p>","choices":["4 &gt; 1 &gt; 2 &gt; 3","1 &gt; 2 &gt; 3 &gt; 4","4 &gt; 3 * 1. &gt; 2","3 &gt; 2 &gt; 1 &gt; 4","2 &gt; 3 &gt; 4 &gt; 1"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDcwMw"},{"id":"OTg-q28","number":28,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Tentukan urutan berdasarkan kecepatan reaksi pembentukan senyawa ester n-propil asetat berikut :</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200408043712.PNG\" style=\"height:118px; width:500px\" /></p>","choices":["1 <em>&gt; </em>3 <em>&gt; </em>2 <em>&gt; </em>4","3 &gt; 1 &gt; 3 &gt; 4","4 &gt; 2 &gt; 3 &gt; 1","4 &gt; 3 &gt; 2 &gt; 1","1 &gt; 2 &gt; 3 &gt; 4"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDcwNA"},{"id":"OTg-q29","number":29,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Dari hasil analisa asam amino suatu tetrapeptida dihasilkan asam amino dari alanin (A), glysin (G), fenilalanin (F) dan valin (V) dalam jumlah yang sama. Berapa kombinasi yang dapat dihasilkan dari keempat asam amino (A, G, F dan V) tersebut ?</p>","choices":["16","20","24","28","30"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDcwNQ"},{"id":"OTg-q30","number":30,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Di bawah ini merupakan reaksi Hell-VoIhard-ZeIinsky, yang banyak dipakai untuk menghasilkan asam amino. Produk reaksi ini adalah:</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20200408051853.PNG\" style=\"height:217px; width:423px\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/NDcwNg"}]
